# Convoke may tap a creature that has a mana ability (CR 702.51a, 601.2g-h): Avacyn's Pilgrim is green and makes {W}, so its
# mana pays only generic mana, but tapped for convoke it pays one of Siege Wurm's {G}. With a Forest for the other {G} and
# five Ornithopters for the {5}, the {5}{G}{G} is paid exactly: the cast must be offered, though counting the Pilgrim as a
# mana source alone leaves a {G} unpaid. With four Ornithopters it is not offered: the Pilgrim taps for convoke or for its
# {W}, never both.
[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Avacyn's Pilgrim
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Siege Wurm
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

